'''Snowball''' is a {{C|Common|common}} knife that was originally obtainable from the [[2025 Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2025]]. It is now only available through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Snowball features a white handle and a blade decorated with swirling snowflake patterns in icy blue and white hues. 

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Snowball (Gun)|matching gun]] under the same name.
* It was one of the weapons used to craft the [[Coal (Effect)|Coal Effect]] during the [[Christmas Event 2025|2025 Christmas Event]].
